":"tvdb_show","id":"72442","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]}]}]},"checkedAt":1793428869892,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":[{"title":"How to Kill a Computer","synopsis":"Eleanor City's landmark tower \"Damocles Tower\". The self-sustaining main computer that manages it rebelled against humans. Being sown by fire and water, they are attacked by a group of mechas who lose control and run away, and the inhabitants just run away. Among such people, Kay and Yuri of WWWA's trouble consultant \"Lovely Angel\" appeared ...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85634.jpg"},{"title":"Do Lovely Angels Prefer Chest Hair?","synopsis":"Kei and Yuri investigate sabotage on the maiden voyage of a luxury space liner, with an older man who may or may not have chest hair.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85635.jpg"},{"title":"Go Ahead, Fall in Love! Love Is Russian Roulette","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair must retrieve a gambling chip stolen from a museum.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85636.jpg"},{"title":"The Case Smells Like Cheesecake and Death","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair investigate the disappearance of a cat from the Bio-Genetics Lab.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85637.jpg"},{"title":"Criados` Heartbeat!","synopsis":"Kei and Yuri are beleaguered and then abducted by an abandoned space station created by a mad scientist, and only little robot Nammo can save them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85638.jpg"},{"title":"Lots of Danger, Lots of Decoys","synopsis":"Kei and Yuri must defend a precious stone prism shipment against pirates.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85639.jpg"},{"title":"Love Is Everything, Risk Your Life to Elope!!","synopsis":"The heir to a travel empire elopes on his wedding day, but his new love tries to extort a ransom from his father. A variety of plot twists ensue.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85640.jpg"},{"title":"Gotta Do It! Love Is What Makes a Woman Explode","synopsis":"Yuri's childhood sweetheart contacts her, but he may be in trouble.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85641.jpg"},{"title":"Beautiful Bodyguards Are a Better Deal","synopsis":"Kei and Yuri are stranded on a Wild West themed frontier planet and run into the local protection racket, which they offer to protect.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85642.jpg"},{"title":"What? We`re the Brutal Bodyguards!","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair go to planet Caspia to ensure the security of the young royal successor and prevent the throne being usurped by a wicked uncle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85643.jpg"},{"title":"Hah Hah Hah, Dresses and Men Should Always Be...","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair have a week off and are invited to a party, but are mistaken for fugitives when they go shopping for dresses.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85644.jpg"},{"title":"The Little Dictator! Let Sleeping Top Secrets...","synopsis":"3WA headquarters is sealed off following the theft of an R&D security system, and suffers a rodent infestation.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85645.jpg"},{"title":"What`s This! My Supple Skin Is a Mess","synopsis":"Dangerous acid-spewing life forms have taken over the sewage facility.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85646.jpg"},{"title":"The Vault or the Vote? A Murderous Day for a Speech","synopsis":"A presidential candidate is targeted for having his past erased, and it's time for annual maintenance of the Pandora's Box security system.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85647.jpg"},{"title":"Dig Here, Meow Meow. Happiness Comes at the End.","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair meet an old cowboy who takes them treasure hunting.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85648.jpg"},{"title":"Leave It to Us! The WWWA Is a Wonderful Job","synopsis":"Kei and Yuri are hired to escort the naive teenage chairman of an important company who wants to see the city, but lose her at the first opportunity.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85649.jpg"},{"title":"Come Out, Come Out, Assassin","synopsis":"3WA's best agent has been assassinated, and the Dirty Pair must find out which of the passengers on a spaceflight is the perpetrator.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85650.jpg"},{"title":"Pardon Us. Trouble`s on the Run, So We`re Coming Through!","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair arrest a difficult character, but getting him to the police station is even more complicated.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85651.jpg"},{"title":"An Unjustified Lover`s Grudge. Let Me Love You Without Revenge","synopsis":"Kei and Yuri are sent to avenge the \"murder\" of an eccentric millionaire's romantic interest, a doll. It's going to be tricky though as they already know who dropped a space pod on the doll's head.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85652.jpg"},{"title":"Nostalgic Blues. Make a Killer Soundtrack","synopsis":"The Dirty Pair are looking for an assassin who has gone to ground. Unfortunately they end up owing him a favour.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85653.jpg"},{"title":"No Way! 463 People Disappeared?","synopsis":"A passenger spaceship on a routine flight arrives in port with nobody aboard.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85654.jpg"},{"title":"We Did It! 463 People Found!","synopsis":"Arthur admits his part in the disappearance mystery, but his plan has been hijacked by the pilots to their own ends.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85655.jpg"},{"title":"Something`s Amiss...!? Our Elegant Revenge","synopsis":"Yuri is injured when the 3WA pull them off a drugs job at the last moment, but is helped by a charming con man.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85656.jpg"},{"title":"Are You Serious? A Condo Is a Dangerous Place...","synopsis":"A door-to-door salesman serial killer is on the loose, and the Dirty Pair are assigned to be a honeypot to catch him.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/85657.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
